    "raw": "A log about the strongest defense of the Skath.",
    "value": "一份关于海鳞族最强防线的日志。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "The First Contact war made the Skath into one of the most paranoid races in the known galaxy. While they will deny that it is fear, and instead chalk it up to 'nerves', there is no doubt to the classic fight-or-flight response a Skath enters when startled. So imagine just how paranoid they could get with *planning* behind it.",
    "value": "第一次接触战争将海鳞族塑造成已知星系中最为多疑的种族之一。尽管他们会否认这是恐惧，而将其归因于“紧张”，但毫无疑问，海鳞族在受惊时会表现出典型的“战或逃”反应。因此不难想象，他们在有计划的背景下会展现出何等程度的偏执。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "This paranoia led directly to the creation of Fortress Worlds. These are elected at random by the Council and declared holy sites. They are then cleansed of all non-Skath lifeforms and their surface virtually covered in weaponry of any available sort. Billions of cannons, missile silos, gravity launchers and the largest military staging platforms in the known universe.",
    "value": "这种偏执直接催生了“堡垒世界”的诞生。这些世界由议会随机选定，并被宣布为圣地。随后，所有非海鳞族生命形式被清除殆尽，地表几乎铺满一切可用的武器系统：数十亿门火炮、导弹发射井、重力投射器，以及已知宇宙中规模最大的军事集结平台。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "Fortress Worlds were instrumental in cementing the Skathian position on the cosmological stage. With these worlds acting as a direct threat to any and all possible aggressors, there is the ever-present threat of vengeance for anyone even daring to *think* about slavery.",
    "value": "堡垒世界在巩固海鳞族于宇宙舞台上的地位方面发挥了关键作用。这些世界对任何潜在的侵略者构成直接威胁，任何人哪怕只是胆敢设想奴役海鳞族，都将面临复仇的永恒威慑。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "The sheer size and weight of the Skathian armed forces in the current age is beyond reckoning, and through their presence alone the League of Non-Aligned Worlds has become a contender alongside the Protectorate.",
    "value": "时至今日，海鳞族武装力量的规模已无法估量。仅凭其存在，不结盟世界联盟就已跻身与守护团并驾齐驱的竞争者之列。"
  }
]